# Borghertz's Warring Hands (jeuno 44): the coffers' operands. A level 75 Warrior. Available (no section): the Eldieme
# coffer: nil, the coffer's own script (its loot). Accepted (a GM), the Old Gauntlets held (a GM): the old-gauntlet
# section off: nil again (190 s later, the coffer back). Completed (a GM), [AF]ZilartCoffer 2 (bit 1 set, a GM): Castle
# Zvahl Baileys' coffer: nil, the coffer's own. Bit 1 cleared (a GM), a full bag: the treasure's item bypass answers 0
# (no room): no bit, noAction; with room: Fighter's Cuisses, [AF]ZilartCoffer 2, while completed. Crawler's Nest's
# coffer (the second optional zone), a full bag: 0: no bit; with room: Fighter's Mask, [AF]ZilartCoffer 6; the coffer
# back (190 s later), bit 2 set: nil, the coffer's own script.
lists TheEldiemeNecropolis/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade CastleZvahlBaileys/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade CrawlersNest/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolis pos=301.5,-0.25,19.99 job=WAR lvl=75
item EldiemeCofferKey
item EldiemeCofferKey
item ZvahlCofferKey
item ZvahlCofferKey
item ZvahlCofferKey
item NestCofferKey
item NestCofferKey
item NestCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer EldiemeCofferKey x1 # available: nil; the coffer's own script
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsWarringHands accepted # a GM
keyitem OldGauntlets                    # a GM
tick 190000                             # the coffer back after 180 s
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer EldiemeCofferKey x1 # the gauntlets held: nil; the coffer's own
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsWarringHands completed # a GM
charvar [AF]ZilartCoffer 2              # a GM: bit 1
warp 110.041,-20.002,106.811 CastleZvahlBaileys
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ZvahlCofferKey x1 # bit 1 set: nil; the coffer's own
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
charvar [AF]ZilartCoffer 0              # a GM
fill-inventory
tick 190000                             # the coffer back
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ZvahlCofferKey x1 # a full bag: the treasure answers 0: no bit; noAction
free-inventory
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # the same coffer (not moved)
trade Treasure_Coffer ZvahlCofferKey x1 # completed, bit 1 unset: Fighter's Cuisses; [AF]ZilartCoffer 2
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 58.9,0.4,69 CrawlersNest
fill-inventory
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer NestCofferKey x1  # bit 2 unset, a full bag: the treasure answers 0: no bit; noAction
free-inventory
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # the same coffer (not moved)
trade Treasure_Coffer NestCofferKey x1  # completed, bit 2 unset: Fighter's Mask; [AF]ZilartCoffer 6
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
tick 190000                             # the coffer back
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer NestCofferKey x1  # bit 2 set: the second coffer section off: nil; the coffer's own script
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
